<title>FRANCE: SUEZ LYONNAISE SEES 3.5 BLN PROFIT.</title>
<headline>SUEZ LYONNAISE SEES 3.5 BLN PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux expects a pre-tax pre-exceptional profit of slightly over 3.5 billion francs.</p>
<p>&quot;We are expecting a pre-tax pre-exceptional (resultat courant) profit of slightly over 3.5 billion francs,&quot; Gerard Mestrallet, management board chairman designate of the group, told an analysts' meeting on Monday.</p>
<p>On Friday he announced a 3.5 billion francs goal for the 1997 net income. Lyonnaise des Eaux and Cie de Suez on Friday announced they plan to merge.</p>
